# An alternative with 4 optional parts makes 16 rules; the progress
# output does not name it below 32 (check_cli).
@lexer
tokens
    ident, a, b, c, d, e, eof, err
'a'                 → a
'b'                 → b
'c'                 → c
'd'                 → d
'e'                 → e
[x-z]+              → ident
.                   → err

@parser
item! = IDENT ["a"] ["b"] ["c"] ["d"]   → 1
